    "There is already something called “%@” here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يوجد بالفعل «%@» هنا."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hier gibt es schon etwas namens „%@“."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ya hay algo llamado «%@» aquí."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« %@ » existe déjà ici."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」はすでにあります。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Já existe algo chamado “%@” aqui."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这里已有名为“%@”的项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Things that make life better but could wait: a holiday, a renovation, the gym. Fund them once the essentials are covered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "أشياء تجعل الحياة أفضل لكنها تحتمل الانتظار: إجازة، تجديد، اشتراك نادٍ. موّلها بعد تغطية الأساسيات."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dinge, die das Leben schöner machen, aber warten können: Urlaub, Renovierung, Fitnessstudio. Fülle sie, wenn das Wichtigste gedeckt ist."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cosas que mejoran tu vida pero pueden esperar: unas vacaciones, una reforma, el gimnasio. Cúbrelas cuando tengas lo esencial resuelto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qui rend la vie plus agréable mais peut attendre : des vacances, des travaux, la salle de sport. À financer une fois l’essentiel couvert."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暮らしを豊かにするけれど急がないもの：旅行、リフォーム、ジムなど。必要な支出をまかなってから割り当てましょう。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coisas que deixam a vida melhor, mas podem esperar: uma viagem, uma reforma, a academia. Reserve para elas depois de cobrir o essencial."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "能让生活更好、但可以缓一缓的开支：度假、装修、健身。先保障必需开支，再给它们分配资金。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This backup was written by a newer version of Embers (format %lld).": {
      "localizations": {
